 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 8504 (lane kit-batch-8504-20261121, group 2): the NE front on Windroosplein from w01-45L (2025-01-30, oblique 46 deg, rectified): 0 the six-storey slab with two stacks of loggias (storeys 1-4, a brick parapet under each opening), two window columns between and a passage at the right end; 1 the seven-storey tower over a glass-block ground; 2 the low wing whose top two storeys are a grey ribbed metal box.",
  "Not described: the stepped terrace fronts on the SW side (w03-225 2025-06-19, tree), the NW end (w06-315 2025-01-30; storey heights there do not match the 3DBAG walls), the courtyard and every other face of this 555-surface pand stay in the window grid. The metal box cantilevers in the photo; the 3DBAG wall is flat."
 ]
